failed the whole snapshot, so while archive.chain.opentensor.ai was unreachable no new registration was recorded and nobody new could submit; every poll also paid a 10s connect timeout.\n\nRead a fresh registration's time from the lite node, which still holds it, use the archive only for blocks past the lite node's window, and when the archive fails estimate the time from the tip (blocks are 12s apart) and leave the archive alone for five minutes before trying it again.","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:42:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T12:44:44Z","closed_at":"2026-10-14T12:44:44Z","merged_at":"2026-10-14T12:44:44Z","merge_commit_sha":"98259eb7edf0fa82283bc29f2afa7be357363afc","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/conjectures-io/conjectures-optimisation-float-kernels/pulls/11/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/conjectures-io/conjectures-optimisation-float-kernels/pulls/11/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/conjectures-io/conjectures-optimisation-float-kernels/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/conjectures-io/conjectures-optimisation-float-kernels/issues/11/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/conjectures-io/conjectures-optimisation-float-kernels/statuses/06be22267301b029a29d22a306e5a61e593848b1","head":{"label":"conjectures-io:fix/chain-watcher-archive-outage","ref":"fix/chain-watcher-archive-outage","sha":"06be22267301b029a29d22a306e5a61e593848b1","user":{"login":"conjectures-io","id":309972092,"node_id":"O_kgDOEnnMfA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/309972092?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conjectures-io","html_url":"https://github.com/conjectures-io","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conjectures-io/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conjectures-io/following{/other_user}","gist